Patches applied to the deps/libdb submodule before building it.

libdb-v2026.10.2-freebsd.patch
	libtool's host patterns freebsd1* and freebsd2* also match FreeBSD
	10-19 and 2x ("freebsd15.1"), so libtool decides the host has no
	shared-library support (and uses a.out versioning).  Anchor the
	patterns to the real FreeBSD 1.x/2.x/3.x releases.  Needed on every
	current FreeBSD; harmless elsewhere.  Not yet upstream.

	Apply:  cd deps/libdb && patch -p1 < ../patches/libdb-v2026.10.2-freebsd.patch
	(deps/build_libdb.sh does this.)
